<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VeriFone upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VeriFone upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Boston said it upgraded VeriFone Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- VeriFone closed Tuesday at 34-1/4. There were no trades yet Wednesday.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
